%% Diagramme de sequence - Planification et realisation d'une maintenance (CU-08)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AM as Agent maintenance
    actor RS as Responsable structure
    participant W as web-app
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant M as maintenance-service
    participant S as asset-service
    participant DB as maintenance_db
    participant N as notification-service

    AM->>W: Cree un plan preventif (bien, periodicite, echeance)
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/maintenance/plans
    G->>M: Creation plan
    M->>S: GET /api/v1/assets/{id} (verification bien)
    S-->>M: Bien actif
    M->>DB: INSERT plan_maintenance
    M->>N: Evenement "plan cree" + alerte echeance programmee
    Note over M,N: Tache planifiee : alerte avant echeance
    N-->>AM: Rappel echeance maintenance
    RS->>W: Declare une panne sur un bien
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/maintenance/interventions (type=panne)
    G->>M: Declaration
    M->>DB: INSERT intervention statut=Nouveau
    M->>N: Notification au responsable maintenance
    AM->>W: Cree ordre d'intervention (date, prestataire, cout prevu)
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/maintenance/interventions/{id}/assign
    G->>M: Assignation
    M->>DB: UPDATE statut=En cours
    M->>S: PATCH /api/v1/assets/{id} (etat=En maintenance)
    Note over AM: Realisation sur le terrain
    AM->>W: Cloture l'intervention (compte-rendu, cout, photos)
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/maintenance/interventions/{id}/close
    G->>M: Cloture
    M->>DB: UPDATE statut=Cloturee + cout
    M->>S: PATCH /api/v1/assets/{id} (etat=Disponible)
    M->>N: Evenement "intervention cloturee"
    M-->>G: 200 OK
    G-->>W: Intervention historisee
